CLASS lhc_ZDPK_EMPLOYEES_UN_M DEFINITION INHERITING FROM cl_abap_behavior_handler.

  PRIVATE SECTION.

    METHODS get_instance_authorizations FOR INSTANCE AUTHORIZATION
      IMPORTING keys REQUEST requested_authorizations FOR zdpk_employees_un_m RESULT result.

    METHODS get_global_authorizations FOR GLOBAL AUTHORIZATION
      IMPORTING REQUEST requested_authorizations FOR zdpk_employees_un_m RESULT result.

    METHODS create FOR MODIFY
      IMPORTING entities FOR CREATE zdpk_employees_un_m.

    METHODS earlynumbering_create FOR NUMBERING
      IMPORTING entities FOR CREATE zdpk_employees_un_m.

    METHODS update FOR MODIFY
      IMPORTING entities FOR UPDATE zdpk_employees_un_m.

    METHODS delete FOR MODIFY
      IMPORTING keys FOR DELETE zdpk_employees_un_m.

    METHODS read FOR READ
      IMPORTING keys FOR READ zdpk_employees_un_m RESULT result.

    METHODS lock FOR LOCK
      IMPORTING keys FOR LOCK zdpk_employees_un_m.

    METHODS filldepartement FOR DETERMINE ON MODIFY
      IMPORTING keys FOR zdpk_employees_un_m~filldepartement.

    METHODS checkLocation FOR VALIDATE ON SAVE
      IMPORTING keys FOR zdpk_employees_un_m~checkLocation.

    METHODS get_instance_features FOR INSTANCE FEATURES
      IMPORTING keys REQUEST requested_features FOR zdpk_employees_un_m RESULT result.

    METHODS SetActive FOR MODIFY
      IMPORTING keys FOR ACTION zdpk_employees_un_m~SetActive RESULT result.

